  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5751e45b3bc551448917ed569792a2a2, type: 3}
  m_Name: 9
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  fullText: Premou, we have made a mistake. I stayed after hours to finish an\nanalysis
    of the Visitor, and I believe the unknown signals we recorded\nstarted when we
    brought it down here. It seems to react to water and is\ninstructed to activate
    as it touches it. Furthermore, while we have not\nfigured out what data the Visitor
    holds, we have repeatedly caught\nsomething coming out of it, as if it were emitting
    some sort of wave. I\nhave reasons to believe this was never meant for us.\n\nIt
    is not a message; it is a beacon. And it is leading someone here.
